{"candidateAnswer":"Around mid-July 2023","evidence":"[D8:9 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Caroline: That photo is stunning! So glad you bonded over our love of nature. Last Friday I went to a council meeting for adoption. It was inspiring and emotional - so many people wanted to create loving homes for children in need. It made me even more determined to adopt.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ffe11250-2e83-5138-b47f-6ee4ce0554f8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to the adoption meeting?","referenceAnswer":"The friday before 15 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170"}}]}